            <string>Clipping method:</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="0" column="1">
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="clippingMethodComboBox">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Plane cuts with an infinite plane (other branches the plane crosses are preserved by connectivity). Plane + sphere cuts with the intersection of the plane and a sphere around the clip point; this confines the cut but may leave a seam ring where the sphere crosses the vessel wall. Plane + patch confines the plane cut to the surface cells near the clip point without creating any seam. Box cuts with an open box whose base face lies in the cut plane; the cut is planar, but the box sides may leave seams if they touch other parts of the surface.</string>
           </property>
           <property name="editable">
            <bool>false</bool>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="1" column="0">
